{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.68000030517578,"text":"A marble statue, about 2 meters tall, made around the 2nd century B.C., found in 1820 by a farmer on the Greek island of Milos. Both her arms are missing, and nobody knows what they held. Dozens of answers have been proposed. An apple, a mirror, a shield, a piece of cloth. The mystery is part of the appeal, because every visitor fills in the arms from imagination, and nobody can be proved wrong.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5},{"word":"marble","start":0.5,"end":0.6800000071525574},{"word":"statue","start":0.6800000071525574,"end":1.1200000047683716},{"word":"about","start":1.440000057220459,"end":1.559999942779541},{"word":"2","start":1.559999942779541,"end":1.7999999523162842},{"word":"meters","start":1.7999999523162842,"end":2.0199999809265137},{"word":"tall","start":2.0199999809265137,"end":2.440000057220459},{"word":"made","start":2.859999895095825,"end":2.9200000762939453},{"word":"around","start":2.9200000762939453,"end":3.259999990463257},{"word":"the","start":3.259999990463257,"end":3.5399999618530273},{"word":"2nd","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":3.759999990463257},{"word":"century","start":3.759999990463257,"end":4.119999885559082},{"word":"B","start":4.119999885559082,"end":4.420000076293945},{"word":"C","start":4.420000076293945,"end":5.28000020980835},{"word":"found","start":5.28000020980835,"end":5.360000133514404},{"word":"in","start":5.360000133514404,"end":5.539999961853027},{"word":"1820","start":5.539999961853027,"end":6.239999771118164},{"word":"by","start":6.239999771118164,"end":6.480000019073486},{"word":"a","start":6.480000019073486,"end":6.940000057220459},{"word":"farmer","start":6.940000057220459,"end":6.940000057220459},{"word":"on","start":6.940000057220459,"end":7.21999979019165},{"word":"the","start":7.21999979019165,"end":7.360000133514404},{"word":"Greek","start":7.360000133514404,"end":7.559999942779541},{"word":"island","start":7.559999942779